  "description": "Independent deterministic file, lookup, calculator, patch, and test oracles for A6 quality tasks.",
  "files": {
    "config/migration.json": "{\"source\":\"sqlite\",\"target\":\"postgresql\",\"dual_write\":true}\n",
    "docs/release.md": "Release checklist\n- Preserve backward compatibility for API responses.\n- Validate cache-off behavior and structured logs.\n- Run scheduler, cache, and release tests before cutover.\n",
    "docs/release_ja.md": "リリース確認\n- APIの後方互換性を確認する。\n- キャッシュ無効化とログ形式を検証する。\n- API behavior may change.\n",
    "src/cache.py": "def can_evict(refcount: int) -> bool:\n    return refcount <= 1\n",
    "src/scheduler.py": "class EngineBusy(RuntimeError):\n    pass\n\n\ndef admit(pending: int, cap: int) -> str:\n    if pending >= cap:\n        raise ValueError(\"full\")\n    return \"admitted\"\n"
  },
